  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-2",
   "section": "Slon",
   "text": "The website's name Slon () is a reference to the blind men and an elephant parable, in which blind people disagreed about what the elephant looked like.",
   "words": 27,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
