  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-6",
   "section": "Slon",
   "text": "Among the first employees of Slon.ru were Russian journalists , Olga Romanova, former deputy editor-in-chief of SmartMoney magazine Yuri Granovsky and former editor-in-chief of Russky Newsweek magazine Dmitry Kuznets.",
